{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39870","headline":"不把渔竿 · 徐夤","name":"不把渔竿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不把渔竿不灌园，策筇吟遶绿芜村。\n得争野老眠云乐，倍感闽王与善恩。\n鸟趂竹风穿静户，鱼吹烟浪喷晴轩。\n何人买我安贫趣，百万黄金未可论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}